================
LEGEND
================

Counter  = C0 or C1 or C2 or C3 or C4
Cell     = Alive or Dead
NextCell = NextAlive or NextDead

================
COLLISIONLAYERS
================

Background
Cell, NextCell
Counter
Relay
Player, Wall

================
RULES
================

( ---------- PHASE 1: every non-wall tile is a cell carrying a counter ---------- )

[ no Cell no NextCell no Wall ] -> [ Dead ]
[ Cell no Counter ] -> [ Cell C0 ]


( ---------- PHASE 2: reset the counters ---------- )

[ C1 ] -> [ C0 ]
[ C2 ] -> [ C0 ]
[ C3 ] -> [ C0 ]
[ C4 ] -> [ C0 ]


( ---------- PHASE 3: orthogonal neighbours ----------
  One EXPLICIT direction at a time. Within a direction the counter rules are
  written high-to-low so a single neighbour cannot chain C0 -> C1 -> C2.
  Do NOT collapse these into un-prefixed rules: an un-prefixed rule expands
  into four copies that run in sequence, and the first copy to fire blocks
  the other three.                                                             )

RIGHT [ Alive | C3 ] -> [ Alive | C4 ]
RIGHT [ Alive | C2 ] -> [ Alive | C3 ]
RIGHT [ Alive | C1 ] -> [ Alive | C2 ]
RIGHT [ Alive | C0 ] -> [ Alive | C1 ]

LEFT  [ Alive | C3 ] -> [ Alive | C4 ]
LEFT  [ Alive | C2 ] -> [ Alive | C3 ]
LEFT  [ Alive | C1 ] -> [ Alive | C2 ]
LEFT  [ Alive | C0 ] -> [ Alive | C1 ]

UP    [ Alive | C3 ] -> [ Alive | C4 ]
UP    [ Alive | C2 ] -> [ Alive | C3 ]
UP    [ Alive | C1 ] -> [ Alive | C2 ]
UP    [ Alive | C0 ] -> [ Alive | C1 ]

DOWN  [ Alive | C3 ] -> [ Alive | C4 ]
DOWN  [ Alive | C2 ] -> [ Alive | C3 ]
DOWN  [ Alive | C1 ] -> [ Alive | C2 ]
DOWN  [ Alive | C0 ] -> [ Alive | C1 ]


( ---------- PHASE 4: diagonal neighbours ----------
  Patterns are collinear, so a diagonal needs two hops. Drop a Relay one tile
  to the right of every Alive, then bump up and down from the Relay: that
  lands on the up-right and down-right diagonals. Relays are deliberately
  allowed to sit on walls, since the tile beyond a wall is still a real
  diagonal neighbour.                                                          )

RIGHT [ Alive | no Relay ] -> [ Alive | Relay ]

UP    [ Relay | C3 ] -> [ Relay | C4 ]
UP    [ Relay | C2 ] -> [ Relay | C3 ]
UP    [ Relay | C1 ] -> [ Relay | C2 ]
UP    [ Relay | C0 ] -> [ Relay | C1 ]

DOWN  [ Relay | C3 ] -> [ Relay | C4 ]
DOWN  [ Relay | C2 ] -> [ Relay | C3 ]
DOWN  [ Relay | C1 ] -> [ Relay | C2 ]
DOWN  [ Relay | C0 ] -> [ Relay | C1 ]

[ Relay ] -> [ ]

( mirror: relay one tile to the LEFT reaches the up-left and down-left diagonals )

LEFT  [ Alive | no Relay ] -> [ Alive | Relay ]

UP    [ Relay | C3 ] -> [ Relay | C4 ]
UP    [ Relay | C2 ] -> [ Relay | C3 ]
UP    [ Relay | C1 ] -> [ Relay | C2 ]
UP    [ Relay | C0 ] -> [ Relay | C1 ]

DOWN  [ Relay | C3 ] -> [ Relay | C4 ]
DOWN  [ Relay | C2 ] -> [ Relay | C3 ]
DOWN  [ Relay | C1 ] -> [ Relay | C2 ]
DOWN  [ Relay | C0 ] -> [ Relay | C1 ]

[ Relay ] -> [ ]


( ---------- PHASE 5: apply Conway's rules ---------- )

[ Alive C2 ] -> [ NextAlive C2 ]
[ Alive C3 ] -> [ NextAlive C3 ]
[ Dead  C3 ] -> [ NextAlive C3 ]
[ Cell ]     -> [ NextDead ]


( ---------- PHASE 6: commit ---------- )

[ NextAlive ] -> [ Alive ]
[ NextDead ]  -> [ Dead ]

